    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f n8n Backup System (Git-Native)\nAutomated daily backup for Workflows and Credentials, transforming GitHub into a real **Version Control System** for n8n.\n\n### \u2699\ufe0f Dual Architecture\n* **Top Branch:** Processes individual JSONs (Logic) and saves each flow individually.\n* **Bottom Branch:** Dumps the Credentials Database (Security).\n\n### \u26a0\ufe0f Requisito Clave\nPara restaurar las credenciales, necesitar\u00e1s la variable de entorno:\n`N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY`\n\n### \ud83e\udde0 Why is it smart?\n1. **Extreme Efficiency:** No infinite folders (`2026-01-14`...). It overwrites existing files.\n2. **Real History:** Git detects internal changes. If a flow doesn't change, it takes no space. If it changes, GitHub saves the difference (Diff).\n3. **Change Resistant:** Uses **Flow ID** as filename. You can rename your flows in n8n as much as you want; history remains intact.",
        "height": 551,
        "width": 505,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "c1c3c40a-041e-4305-8812-a9fec36997f0",
      "name": "Master Note",
